%F A402034 Equals Pi^2/2 - log(2*Pi) - 1 - 2*Sum_{k>=1} (zeta(2*k)-1)/(2*k-1).
%F A402034 Equals Pi^2/2 - log(2*Pi) - 1 - Sum_{m>=2} log((m+1)/(m-1))/m.
%F A402034 Equals lim_{p prime, p->infinity} -log(abs(Product_{k=2..p-1} sin(Pi*p/k)))/p.
